1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,120
Omar: Floor four. Mrs. Lin lives here.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:06,302
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: The Last Floor. Part
two of three: the stairs.

3
00:00:06,622 --> 00:00:09,966
Mrs. Lin: Pip! There you are! Who locked
my stairs?

4
00:00:10,636 --> 00:00:11,980
Bell: I did. Rule one.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:12,664
Mrs. Lin: ...Fair.

6
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:15,615
Bell: Go up. Seal the door behind you.

7
00:00:16,285 --> 00:00:19,388
Omar: Floor four, five, six... that's a
lot of floors.

8
00:00:19,508 --> 00:00:21,173
Zara: Keep climbing. Don't count.

9
00:00:21,843 --> 00:00:23,936
Zara: Floor five. The stairs are blocked!

10
00:00:24,606 --> 00:00:26,575
Bell: Push! Everyone push!

11
00:00:27,245 --> 00:00:28,251
Zara: ...Direct hit.

12
00:00:28,921 --> 00:00:32,047
Mrs. Lin: That's my sister's flat. She
says never open it.

13
00:00:32,717 --> 00:00:34,724
Mrs. Lin: Dot, you're not well.

14
00:00:35,394 --> 00:00:37,155
Bell: Leave her. Lock the door.

15
00:00:37,825 --> 00:00:39,588
Mrs. Lin: Goodbye, Dot. Click.

16
00:00:40,258 --> 00:00:42,960
Zara: They're gaining. Floor seven.

17
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,831
Omar: Twelve floors. My legs filed a
complaint.

18
00:00:46,501 --> 00:00:48,745
Bell: Shortcut! Through the floor ten
hall!

19
00:00:49,415 --> 00:00:56,047
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part two of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the roof. Follow for part three.

